{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d61d3fb0692ab832aec3ae287d9ba3fc642563d473e6eae9c3c7426d3d93e702",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25d49a1c0879ef06730d4ed64936b27d3ca57d736168c861067996549b2b27d9",
      "text": "派对的主角是",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a72cba355e2017372aca00c6c49ba55cbb8c54e4f87bb34c592a0a924e295589",
      "text": "某天放学后，High×Joker的成员们商量起\n旬的生日事宜。\n考虑到即使搞惊喜也会被旬看穿，\n大家决定提前告诉旬。\n看着大家兴高采烈筹备的样子，旬……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000028:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000028:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25d49a1c0879ef06730d4ed64936b27d3ca57d736168c861067996549b2b27d9",
      "text": "派对的主角是",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:757a2308f11aef312d3dd09364e9f18cee12c79157887533da604490187e54b7",
      "text": "话说回来，今天旬好慢啊。\n发生什么事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b1234dabaa25d5c42c803d4d5763058515a3f6bc91b1ba946a94311f7dfacde",
      "text": "他说要帮老师……处理点事，所以会晚点来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0d595c32bdd1eaebff1d021e407829801164c160b473b58dff8dbc73f1e7e8c",
      "text": "这样啊。……啊！那趁现在\n我有件事想跟你们商量，可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0567f6c1d74db4479b27b236fa0da49c053437de404663dd8cf2476f17febd09",
      "text": "是要瞒着旬亲说悄悄话吗？\n难不成，你考不及格了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c166f65b29304aff7c875e37ecd81528251fcc09edb0a5a43e3763a99a9e849d",
      "text": "哈哈，不是啦。\n是商量旬的生日该怎么办。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96ec346da719ed3a245984959f0d816302c06f48a288f4de244b0edee7c6cb8a",
      "text": "那当然！必须办派对吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7b343404357461e97857afd08b064c6588beaaf4582e19feca8b7cf00956014",
      "text": "嗯……想大家一起……帮他庆祝呢。\n我也……赞成办派对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d0e06360b178fdcd9cca458b92c394b1fd8edc150d33f1f7d2af017fbc23207",
      "text": "按照旬的脾气，办惊喜派对的话\n大概……不对，绝对会被看穿的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2731c4685d35e781af8c78d89f52ae42c857adea2bd7dd35ac20c28ff64881bd",
      "text": "而且，今年元旦还有新年的第一份工作，\n接下来会很忙吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c415eb74b4e1ca50da0872aebf79be05490aa2bf658dbd62dba81d2e24514c2",
      "text": "嗯……先跟他说吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4a92a80cdc0655c9ae75c0973d0e6781c7f13a4f68e8660266972611e038bab",
      "text": "就是说啊。而且要是有谁问我“是不是瞒着什么”，\n我感觉自己肯定会全招了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_a:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfba0ee402a59263334d9d7d3fd5976b38e7142a3932d26b872048166702d21a",
      "text": "抱歉我来迟了。\n……你们在傻笑什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9561d2f12176943b44fd0c4ed2e58736024cc76c262c0ba6c6d7f17fb108516",
      "text": "哇，吓我一跳！帮老师做事辛苦啦。\n刚才我们正在商量你生日的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca48896b899e7a65ee9531f7ea6ddd9040e1e747292024d85fe77697600038a6",
      "text": "一月一日不就能见到了吗。\n口头说一声就行了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0e7a27eb6a9d5e8e8ed5f03aa17d8204fa22809212204977c6b19265c255731",
      "text": "才不是呢！\n就是要热热闹闹地开派对嘛～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3737a3d081af346cce21638e63bed359a5b0e16e4772431ffe00a83bbe1ebb57",
      "text": "大家还是想热热闹闹地给旬庆祝生日啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a43ae5adaa14ec8391671e9eb4511859c3e19cf2e5c65ab3f1b08a6bb1fa18fa",
      "text": "我也……想开……派对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d58788068be2aa10e32ba1297443db54658c43c9a8f76ba4a99f78baf5e97a69",
      "text": "明明不用特意做这种事的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7d94afb663dc88e7c217c45c1f9a598e42cf329be1332ae31b8db500cb068ec",
      "text": "……我知道了。既然你们都说到这份上了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35aed4b6b278779961b3be1958fbcd1d8912afdd263870b3c1fad02683422859",
      "text": "太好啦～！就该这样嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c74e65ebc58284438b7ae69115b0160b07b1d766af52cca3c4b4b587cc717381",
      "text": "谢谢你……\n我们会努力……准备的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000164:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f86f6fbd5f09542b2c0010b70a72104037629b3a9bddb0cf2fdebc2633bf146",
      "text": "练习结束！我们今天\n还要去买派对用的东西，就先走啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000208:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eda0fff85c4b7845fbb78e8d51be3d1dabbc8d15a82c8ccb7b49f0a5fc8eb5f1",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n路上小心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_b:cmd-000227:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8b35bf1c1e2c9ddcb3a89f6f27cc66bf1e89e3cb803932d6584bfb56a134f74",
      "text": "大家为什么\n能那么开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:827d6f4c962e5e30c3719a2ae6e2162e384e98e552c699c55d5a2de3f5660aba",
      "text": "旬先生在帮隼人先生筹备生日派对的时候，\n是什么心情呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c48b10a44d970cdc16c622e95f60249dc61bece7779409eea480d354ea55e2fc",
      "text": "我当时只觉得……明明隼人自己都已经察觉到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5999cb5a1c7d785b3ba7180af8719ccafa90fcfea85e3e2c49e89ed355afa806",
      "text": "虽然是这样，但当时不开心吗？\n那个时候的旬先生，看起来也很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:874ef2aeed14a69ccbc177b60f8658e7aa558be131bedd0b12ef25c43417fdb3",
      "text": "……看到他高兴，感觉倒也不坏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c40179b1ea5ac7eea45f8228a6617b6aee7153df051fc243af5023ab34067c49",
      "text": "我想大家肯定也是带着同样的心情\n在行动的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03fa57ad3423d5edb3344e28c062e79afe9f658f5c8fdb35c59118a05f8c45e7",
      "text": "差点忘了！\n我有事想拜托制作人酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74e0c265cc14acba27b616d01e5debe7007b26419b1b77c398e82c00bb2fdf1c",
      "text": "旬亲的生日派对，\n制作人酱也一定要来参加哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a2b4b616585937e75f4a4e49c4c7280a75aabe2439cd5571fff4dafa9f5b84c",
      "text": "一定要来哦！好啦，\n旬亲！拜拜咻☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4beae26be025670e546b7f2e7c5270360d7321fcf12e5dc449fdd4b883382e01",
      "text": "他还是一如既往地毛毛躁躁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4326dfd11e09eacb20ade3143ae5efde0874707931c4684e2f8a35c28a08f81e",
      "text": "哈哈……\n生日派对，真让人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48212b6f97aff418c18d32d1c2d04d48c13b89f73beec67ca0e0f3ce1db9e101",
      "text": "蛋糕预订好啦……\n这个……是蛋糕的收据……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b76af1794a06c81ddade7becb21539c6b3278427c171344b5d5a8eb01179f4",
      "text": "谢谢你。准备进行得顺利吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acff4582502b90e7ac53e250f7bc12f3704a7479a7691e2f3876ce0844290ef7",
      "text": "嗯……挺顺利的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0633e2e3b094cbf5f7ee7e5347c5ac35eb18fc6eeee0329164749c4934dea16b",
      "text": "现在四季和春名……\n去买装饰品了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f3a528a6c9c0952be337294a9fdbff9f2f53bb809fcf3aade1831b1d8b1301e",
      "text": "等碰头之后……还有练习……\n那边我也会加油的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88e65e206d97c8cefa80d188bd21082267d6d3264ece2af9fd11c6a7dabaa97b",
      "text": "我也会全力支援的。两边都要加油哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9c372a0df7f6591318668650551a1b5c00b95049dfba3266d7a7801e6c5c76b",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n谢谢您……帮忙……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000027:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:620213a2b07a47ac5cc26852997be28e3ce5b36e626342ce3c5d745dc5af17ea",
      "text": "派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c13898139d7dbc0cc8ebdf8086ec215357d0a3957b1e267a6b0748507787e086",
      "text": "预备——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b98bef352ed6435731c832182ea9f73be67f96a243e00c4354ab38bc5148d60",
      "text": "生日快乐，旬！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e310da3dc7b2bfaca63869ee2953704960114b108656bbe191fc06567035e4",
      "text": "祝你生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "谢谢大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adcab4c69fdf6808bd962aa1f18c69f5a2fc1a0d1cf6576b6c69c7bb87627a24",
      "text": "给今天的主角旬亲送礼物！\n来，“今日主角”绶带！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a6b6642e4ec03ec03ec1935ae8db04df4b6edfdae55fd3a2539bb0c4b08967a",
      "text": "这个未免太……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b5747e96d97b1b7e005e25726d54942c8a0c27db6348161b578b2c458629004",
      "text": "今天就让大家热热闹闹地给你庆祝吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78f82e5dcb0c4f68253ba4c1119ad09f08155945309dc3dbd11d1d54a99dd1b0",
      "text": "你们的心意我很开心，但这也太夸张了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0c492b433ae39d8d01d18e558f029e84bbeeb42f0c8fe1aa2b6532438f5b8a5",
      "text": "不夸张……哦。因为大家……\n都很想……替旬庆祝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4736617eadf57abc206312036ee143169c00b2187c4cfd963c65e814376cd561",
      "text": "因为拿到了压岁钱，\n我可是下了大本钱买礼物的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a13e6b814425a8c12a9b40feb218f3279c2cbb4086aeee8325928633d516d6e",
      "text": "我也是干劲满满挑选的，你就好好期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:166a3cde4293b9b949a8d7e5d088b69eaec226ccd6fc588ed327d6e3382fbdfc",
      "text": "……谢谢大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000187:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0aad446b3132b4955938963ebf7da1a0fdbd3a3757ff7d8504013a25d4ed922",
      "text": "旬看起来很高兴……太好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48385ad76a18c6bd3131a83ccc8fb8ea42698b7b31ce14b1cdbf1c687201bdf3",
      "text": "明年和后年也大家一起庆祝吧！\n那么，干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_e:cmd-000230:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efc3ba8d926ed73f37525fa74a2cabea0267401c4a2e372c040325c8bdf0be93",
      "text": "干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
